B = [
    ('Tupperware', 'North America', '1950s-70s', 'homeware', 'In the style of Tupperware, cheerful domestic order in translucent, slightly frosted material with a matte waxy finish. Soft rounded corners, plump friendly volumes and snug, tight-fitting joints. Forms are designed to nest and repeat in neat, tidy modular stacks. Colours are optimistic mid-century kitchen hues of avocado green, harvest gold, tangerine, pale turquoise, pink, mustard and almond, used as bold flat single colours. No ornament beyond moulded rings and simple ribs. Bright, wholesome, practical, suburban and joyful.'),
    ('Lodge', 'North America', '19th century-present', 'homeware', 'In the style of Lodge, heavy, plain, indestructible forms in cast iron with a rough pebbly matte surface. Thick walls, rounded utilitarian volumes, sturdy loop-shaped details and generous practical curves, with no decoration beyond a few raised ridges and a small cast mark. Colour is matte charcoal black with glossy dark brown patina, slightly rusty edges and worn patches. Rustic, honest, campfire and cabin warmth, made to last generations and look better with use.'),
    ('Nambu ironworks', 'East Asia', '17th century-present', 'homeware', 'In the style of Nambu ironworks, weighty cast-iron forms with rounded, bulging volumes and a quiet, austere, wabi-sabi presence. Surfaces carry rows of small raised bumps like hailstones in a tight regular grid, or finely cast relief motifs of pine, cranes, blossoms and waves, sometimes with fine silver inlay. Finish is matte black, deep brown or rust. Small knob-like accents, gracefully curved dark metal details and short elegant projections. Simple, heavy, contemplative and ceremonial.'),
    ('Arita porcelain', 'East Asia', '17th-19th century', 'ceramics', 'In the style of Arita porcelain, refined thin white porcelain with a milky body, clear sparkling glaze and a great deal of generous empty space. Crisp cobalt blue painted decoration of landscapes, pines, bamboo, cranes and flowers sits in asymmetrical, minimalist compositions with delicate fluid brushstrokes. Enamelled touches of red, green, yellow and sky blue are used sparingly. Outlines are elegant and crisp, including faceted and lobed edges. Airy, graceful, calm and exact, like quiet tea house tableware.'),
    ('Imari ware', 'East Asia', '17th-19th century', 'ceramics', 'In the style of Imari ware, flamboyant, dense, sumptuous decoration that leaves little blank white. A rich palette of deep underglaze cobalt blue, fiery iron red and lavish gold, with panels of chrysanthemums, peonies, phoenixes, fans, waves and brocade-like patterns packed side by side. Blue areas alternate with red and gilded floral scrolls. Outlines are lobed and scalloped with ornate edges. Glossy glaze, heavy ornament, opulent and festive like woven silk brocade.'),
    ('Satsuma ware', 'East Asia', '19th century', 'ceramics', 'In the style of Satsuma ware, jewel-like, glowing surfaces of cream-ivory glaze with a fine network of crackle. Every area is covered in miniature, densely painted scenes with tiny figures, gardens, mountains and blossoms in vivid enamels of red, green and blue, enriched with lavish raised gold and bands of brocade pattern at borders. Elaborate sculpted and pierced details. Highly detailed, warm, glowing, precious and ornate, like an export-era cabinet treasure.'),
    ('Moser', 'Europe', '1900s-30s', 'glass', 'In the style of Moser, luxurious Bohemian crystal richness with heavy cut and engraved decoration. Deep facets, fluting and columns, gold-gilded edges and enamelled gold frames, with etched floral and animal motifs such as stags, swans and acanthus leaves. Intense transparent colour in alexandrite purple, emerald green, cobalt, ruby, amber and smoky topaz. Rich, jewelled, glowing in warm lamplight, blending Belle Epoque grandeur with Art Deco elegance.'),
    ('Tolix', 'Europe', '1930s', 'furniture', 'In the style of Tolix, tough, thin, urban industrial design pressed from single sheets of steel. Simple tapered lines, rounded pressed curves, perforations used as the only pattern, and reinforced edges. Repeatable, economical forms with a visibly utilitarian build. Finish is matte lacquer, powder-coat or galvanised raw zinc in red, dark green, yellow, black, grey and silver, with dents, scuffs and a worn patina. Factory canteen and cafe terrace character, honest and unfussy.'),
    ('Louis Poulsen', 'Europe', '1920s-60s', 'lighting', 'In the style of Louis Poulsen, calm, sculptural Scandinavian restraint where light is softened and glare is controlled. Layered concentric curves, overlapping discs or dozens of overlapping leaf-like plates form smooth symmetrical shapes. Materials are polished steel, chrome, brass, copper and white lacquer with soft warm reflections. Smooth, restrained, elegant and perfectly proportioned, giving a soft diffused glow and a quietly luxurious modernist calm.'),
    ('Anglepoise', 'Europe', '1930s', 'lighting', 'In the style of Anglepoise, technical, balanced and flexible engineering shown honestly. Slender jointed members, exposed coiled springs, small pivots and a conical form poised in mid-air like a drawing compass, grounded by a heavy stepped round base. Enamel or powder-coated metal in cream, black, red, grey, racing green and polished chrome. Everything looks adjustable and functional, with a drawing office and workshop atmosphere, lean, precise and a little vintage.'),
    ('Moorcroft', 'Europe', '1900s-30s', 'ceramics', 'In the style of Moorcroft, English art pottery feel with hand-painted designs outlined in raised lines like cloisonne. Lush stylised plants, flowers, fruit and toadstools in Art Nouveau rhythm fill the surface with flowing curves. Deep jewel-toned glazes of royal blue, forest green, burgundy, plum and gold, with rich flambe runs and a smooth, glossy, velvety depth. Rounded, generous shapes, luminous colour and a precious, collectable Edwardian handmade feel.'),
    ('Emma Bridgewater', 'Europe', '1990s-present', 'ceramics', 'In the style of Emma Bridgewater, cheerful cottagey earthenware feel in cream glaze with hand-sponged spots, dots, hearts, stars and stripes in blue, red and green. Bold black hand-lettered mottoes and rustic farm animals in simple painterly forms. Chunky, rounded shapes with irregular painted edges and speckled glaze. Warm, homely, slightly wonky and full of friendly character, like a kitchen dresser on a Sunday morning.'),
    ('Portmeirion', 'Europe', '1960s-70s', 'ceramics', 'In the style of Portmeirion, lush, abundant botanical decoration embossed and printed on a cream or white ground. Naturalistic flowers, ferns, fruit, butterflies and bees are crowded with leaves and vines in the manner of a Victorian botanical print book. Rich colours of burgundy, fern green, gold and cobalt blue. Chunky forms, scalloped and wide-edged outlines and relief texture beneath the print. Cottage garden, apothecary, cosy and plentiful.'),
    ('Rosenthal', 'Europe', '1950s-70s', 'ceramics', 'In the style of Rosenthal, sleek modern porcelain in smooth, pure white, with clean silhouettes, rounded cylinders, geometric ribs and sculptural relief. Thin gold or platinum edging and abstract hand-painted or printed patterns in black, cobalt, orange and brown, with bold stripes, pastel bands and playful 1970s psychedelic swirls. Crisp, glossy, translucent and elegant yet relaxed, a modernist gallery feel.'),
    ('Lomonosov Porcelain', 'Russia and Eastern Europe', '1920s', 'ceramics', 'In the style of Lomonosov Porcelain, thin white porcelain used as a canvas for striking graphic energy. Geometric abstract shapes in flat red, black and white, bold angular lettering, stars, factories and stylised figures in the manner of revolutionary agitprop. Also a classic cobalt net pattern with gilded cell edges and small white relief bumps. Flat bold colour, dynamic diagonal compositions, a stern idealistic mood and a historical museum feel.'),
    ('Gzhel', 'Russia and Eastern Europe', '17th century-present', 'ceramics', 'In the style of Gzhel, folk decoration painted entirely in cobalt blue on bright white glaze. Brushstrokes shade fluidly from deep ink to pale sky blue, forming flowing flowers, leaves, scrolls, dots and drops that wrap around the form. Glossy smooth surfaces, a clean blue and white contrast, rounded plump forms and a joyful, fresh, handmade charm. Decoration is hand-brushed with confident single strokes, leaving plenty of bright white ground around each motif.'),
    ('Khokhloma', 'Russia and Eastern Europe', '17th century-present', 'woodwork', 'In the style of Khokhloma, glowing gold-like swirling patterns painted on black or deep red lacquer. Curling vines, rowan berries, strawberries, leaves and flowers in red, black, gold and green flow in rhythmic curves across glossy varnished wood. A shiny golden-yellow undertone shows through the hardened varnish. Rich, warm, curvilinear, festive and fairy-tale peasant treasure. Ornament is hand-brushed in confident repeating curls, evenly spread over the whole surface with little empty ground.'),
    ('Kutahya and Iznik ceramics', 'Middle East', '16th-18th century', 'ceramics', 'In the style of Kutahya and Iznik ceramics, intense colour painted under crystal-clear glaze, with cobalt blue, turquoise, sage green, tomato red and white. Symmetrical, flowing patterns of tulips, carnations, hyacinths, rosebuds, long saw-edged leaves and curling arabesques repeat across surfaces, with radiating floral rosettes and tile-like repetition. Glossy, bright, crisp and elegant, evoking mosque walls and bazaars. Colour areas are crisp and flat, with fine dark outlines and bright white ground showing between motifs.'),
    ('Talavera de Puebla', 'Latin America', '17th century-present', 'ceramics', 'In the style of Talavera de Puebla, thick creamy white glossy tin glaze painted by hand in cobalt blue, yellow, green, orange and black. Flowers, birds, vines, geometric borders and Moorish-inspired arabesques are laid down in bold brushwork, with slightly uneven edges, drips and pooling glaze. Rustic, festive, joyful, like a sunlit courtyard and hacienda kitchen. Colours stay bright and flat, edged with a thin dark outline, with white ground left between motifs.'),
    ('Royal Selangor', 'Southeast Asia', '1900s-present', 'homeware', 'In the style of Royal Selangor, polished silvery grey pewter with a soft lustrous gleam and either smooth or hammered finish. Heavy-bottomed, rounded forms with simple curves, sometimes mixed with dark wood or leather accents. Engraved or embossed decoration of hibiscus flowers, bamboo, batik-like flowers and rope borders. Cool, bright, refined, with a tropical colonial elegance. Surfaces are clean and tactile, with ornament kept shallow and restrained against large plain areas of polished metal.'),
    ('Lego', 'Europe', '1970s-present', 'toys', 'In the style of Lego, glossy hard plastic in saturated primary red, blue, yellow and white plus black, grey and green. Everything is a rectangular modular volume with a regular grid of round studs on the surface, crisp moulded edges and visible seams, so any subject reads as assembled from simple bricks. Figures have cylindrical yellow heads with dot eyes and a simple smile, claw hands and blocky bodies. Graphics use bold colour fields, clean line diagrams, chunky rounded sans-serif lettering and bright playful lighting.'),
    ('Playmobil', 'Europe', '1970s-present', 'toys', 'In the style of Playmobil, small hard plastic look with oversized round heads, simple dot eyes, a curved smile line, C-shaped hands and stiff jointed limbs on a standardised block body. Bright primary red, yellow, blue and green plus brown and grey in a matte to satin finish. Scenes are built as small dioramas with thin moulded details and clip-on accessories. Graphics use yellow and blue accents, a cheerful rounded lettering style and soft even lighting.'),
    ('Hornby', 'Europe', '1930s-60s', 'toys', 'In the style of Hornby, nostalgic mid-century British model railway look in tinplate and die-cast metal. Glossy dark green, maroon, black, cream and crimson paint with fine gold lining, polished brass accents, tiny rivets and slim railings, and tin buildings with printed brickwork. Graphics are blue or red with a ruled border and a painted illustration of speed over green countryside, with old-fashioned serif and block capitals. Warm catalogue charm.'),
    ('Meccano', 'Europe', '1920s-60s', 'toys', 'In the style of Meccano, engineering construction kit look of perforated flat metal strips, girders and plates with evenly spaced round holes, bolted together with tiny hex nuts and bolts. Red and green enamel or zinc and brass finishes, with brass gears, flanged wheels and cranks. Graphics show an illustrated scene of a huge machine at work in muted red, green and cream, with ornate Edwardian serif lettering, banner panels, line drawings and numbered parts like an engineering manual.'),
    ('Matchbox', 'Europe', '1950s-60s', 'toys', 'In the style of Matchbox, tiny die-cast scale models with subdued realistic period colours of pastel green, cream, powder blue and brick red, silver painted trim and clear glazing, with soft cast detail and everyday ordinary subjects. Graphics are small, yellow and red, with a simple line drawing and a bold white-on-red numbered label feel. Surfaces are clean and slightly toy-like, with small neat proportions. Modest, collectable, nostalgic and quietly charming.'),
    ('Hot Wheels', 'North America', '1968-1970s', 'toys', 'In the style of Hot Wheels, high-energy speed look with sparkling candy-coloured metallic paint in magenta, aqua, lime, orange and gold. Exaggerated low wide stance, oversized rear proportions, exposed chrome, flame and stripe decals and thin red pinstripes. Graphics have a flaming bold italic lettering style, orange loops, cartoon speed blurs and red, yellow and blue 1970s motifs. Loud, glossy, fast and rebellious.'),
    ('Barbie house style', 'North America', '1960s-present', 'toys', 'In the style of Barbie house style, saturated hot pink dominating everything, accented with turquoise, white and lilac. Glossy moulded plastic with dream-home glamour, miniature fashion accessories, slim elongated figures with long ponytails, arched eyebrows and side-glancing painted eyes. Graphics use a candy pink backdrop, swirling script lettering, sparkles and hearts. Sweet, glamorous and aspirational, with both 1960s retro and modern glam variations.'),
    ('Mattel', 'North America', '1960s-80s', 'toys', 'In the style of Mattel, bright glossy moulded vinyl and plastic in strong primary red, blue and yellow with a hot pink accent. Rounded friendly forms, chunky heroic figures with exaggerated muscles and painted details. Graphics feature splashy painted or photographed illustration with starburst flashes, bold block lettering with outline and drop shadow, and retro 1970s and 80s cartoon motifs. Loud, toy-aisle fun.'),
    ('Fisher-Price', 'North America', '1950s-70s', 'toys', 'In the style of Fisher-Price, chunky, rounded, toddler-safe forms in plastic and painted wood with thick rounded corners everywhere. Primary red, blue, yellow and green with white, simple smiling faces made of two dot eyes, dotted rims, bead-like round details and round-headed figures with simple painted faces. Lithographed surfaces with simple cartoon animals and rounded sans-serif lettering. Nursery cheerfulness, sturdy mid-century proportions and friendly safety.'),
    ('Steiff', 'Europe', '1900s-present', 'toys', 'In the style of Steiff, soft plush made of mohair, felt or woven fur in honey gold, cream, caramel brown and grey. Shoe-button black eyes, a stitched nose and mouth in dark thread, long jointed limbs, a slight hump on the back, fine stitched seams and a plump hand-stuffed softness. A small shiny metal accent and tiny tag detail. Realistic proportions, antique worn feel, warm sentimental nursery mood and soft studio lighting.'),
    ('Ravensburger', 'Europe', '1950s-present', 'toys', 'In the style of Ravensburger, sturdy family-friendly feel with a blue banner stripe and a small blue triangle mark. Glossy painted illustrations in a detailed, realistic fantasy manner with saturated colour, soft gradients and warm glow, filled with castles, fairs, fairytale landscapes and busy town scenes and cheerful friendly characters. Clean bright cartoon illustration, a bold rounded title face and a playful European family feel.'),
    ('Schleich', 'Europe', '1980s-present', 'toys', 'In the style of Schleich, hand-painted hard rubbery finish with finely sculpted anatomy, realistic proportions and subtle airbrushed shading. Animals in bay, chestnut, grey and black with white socks, fine strand texture in manes and tails, glossy eyes, soft gradient painting on belly and muzzle and a satin matte finish. Fantasy creatures follow the same refined realism. Presented against a green nature backdrop.'),
    ('Bandai', 'East Asia', '1980s-present', 'toys', 'In the style of Bandai, crisp, hobby-grade plastic model look with clean panel lines, colour blocking in white, red, blue and yellow, v-shaped chevron details and antenna-like crests. Mix of glossy and matte plastic with chrome, foil, gold and metallic details, and small decal-like markings. Graphics show a dramatic painted pose against fiery explosions and bright starry skies, with clean modern Japanese product graphics in bold and condensed sans-serif lettering.'),
    ('Tomy', 'East Asia', '1970s-80s', 'toys', 'In the style of Tomy, compact, precise Japanese design with bright, clean plastic and die-cast metal, glossy red, blue, white and yellow paint, thin black details with chrome accents, transforming parts and cute small-scale forms. Graphics use a bold red or blue header, an illustrated racing scene and cheerful 1970s sans-serif lettering with simple stripes, neat panel graphics and precise small details.'),
    ('Sanrio', 'East Asia', '1970s-present', 'characters', 'In the style of Sanrio, kawaii cuteness with round simple faces, tiny black dot eyes spaced wide apart, a small oval nose or no mouth, thick uniform soft outlines and big heads on short bodies. Pastel pink, baby blue, lavender, mint and white with a red bow accent. Hearts, stars, strawberries and tiny flowers scatter over gloss sticker finishes, with rounded bubble lettering in cute handwriting, glitter and lots of white space. Sweet candy-coloured gift-shop mood.'),
    ('Pop Mart', 'East Asia', '2010s-present', 'toys', 'In the style of Pop Mart, collectable designer vinyl look with oversized round heads, tiny bodies, large glossy eyes in turquoise or pink and small fanged smiles. Sculpted fur, hoods, wings and crowns, a matte pastel finish in baby blue, mint, peach, lavender and cream, with sharp painted details. Clean glossy colour-block graphics and a small logo. Sweet but quirky, modern urban art-toy mood.'),
    ('Studio Ghibli', 'East Asia', '1980s-2010s', 'animation', 'In the style of Studio Ghibli, hand-painted animation feel with lush watercolour and gouache backgrounds, towering cumulus clouds in deep blue skies, rolling green meadows, wind in the grass, foggy forests, old stone villages and steam-age machinery with soft rounded edges. Characters have simple faces with small dot-like noses, big expressive eyes and natural proportions, gently flowing hair and clothes in earthy cream, olive, sky blue and warm red. Soft cel shading, warm glowing light, hand-drawn detail, a quiet pastoral and fantastical atmosphere.'),
    ('Pixar', 'North America', '1995-present', 'animation', 'In the style of Pixar, polished 3D computer animation with rounded, squash-and-stretch forms, big expressive eyes and exaggerated but appealing proportions. Soft translucent skin, detailed fur, and convincing plastic, metal and fabric textures. Warm cinematic lighting with strong colour planning, saturated yet harmonious palettes, shallow depth of field and a heartfelt storybook feel. Environments are packed with tiny believable details, glossy reflections and soft shadows with a clean modern family-film finish.'),
    ('Disney classic', 'North America', '1930s-50s', 'animation', 'In the style of Disney classic, hand-inked cel animation with rubbery round shapes, bold black outlines, big eyes with highlights and expressive squash-and-stretch poses. Lush painted backgrounds in soft watercolour with storybook castles, deep forests and twinkling night skies. Palette of royal blue, rose pink, golden yellow and emerald with pastel gradients, layered depth, dreamy glowing light, ornate curlicue lettering and warm nostalgic 1940s picture-book charm.'),
    ('Aardman', 'Europe', '1990s-present', 'animation', 'In the style of Aardman, stop-motion clay with visible thumbprint texture, wide mouths full of big teeth, round bulging eyes with tiny pupils, lumpy bodies and plasticine skin in warm earthy tones. Cosy British interiors with patterned wallpaper, chunky cardboard and wood details, small gadgets and contraptions, soft practical lighting and slightly wobbly handmade imperfections. Charming, comic and deadpan. Everything looks sculpted by hand, with soft rounded edges, fingerprint marks and playful oversize features.'),
    ('Laika', 'North America', '2009-present', 'animation', 'In the style of Laika, stop-motion craft with intricately carved faces, delicate printed expressions, stylised angular or spindly bodies and textured knitted and sewn costumes. Atmospheric miniature sets with moody lighting, moss, mist and dark woodland, a slightly eerie and gothic palette of teal, dusty purple, ochre and charcoal with punches of bright colour. Tactile handmade detail down to individual hair, wood grain and fabric weave, with a dreamy fairy-tale spookiness.'),
    ('Cartoon Network studio style', 'North America', '1990s-2010s', 'animation', 'In the style of Cartoon Network studio style, flat bold-colour 2D cartoon look with thick uniform outlines, geometric simplified characters, huge heads, dot or pie-cut eyes and noodle limbs. Exaggerated reaction faces, graphic backgrounds in solid saturated fields of magenta, teal, lime and orange, retro-futuristic shapes and chunky sans-serif lettering with checkerboard or stripe motifs. Clean vector shapes, quirky off-kilter perspective and a loud, irreverent, pop-art look.'),
    ('Hanna-Barbera', 'North America', '1960s-70s', 'animation', 'In the style of Hanna-Barbera, limited-animation TV cartoon look with thick brown-black outlines and flat colours with minimal shading. Gaudy mid-century backgrounds painted in loose blobs with repeating trees, rocks and bushes. Characters wear a single colour outfit with a matching collar line and have big round noses, with the head cleanly separated from the body. Saturated orange, turquoise, brown and mustard palette, simple rounded shapes and a cheerful retro Saturday-morning feel.'),
    ('Warner cartoons', 'North America', '1940s-50s', 'animation', 'In the style of Warner cartoons, hand-drawn rubbery, loose characters with extreme squash-and-stretch takes, wide toothy grins, white gloved hands, long ears and beaks and sharp expressive poses. Stylised painted desert, forest and city backgrounds with flat angular mid-century shapes, bold ink outlines and saturated colour in orange, sky blue, brown and grey. Concentric-ring graphics with a red and gold shield look and a zippy, irreverent slapstick attitude.'),
    ('Toei Animation', 'East Asia', '1960s-80s', 'animation', 'In the style of Toei Animation, cel animation with bold clean outlines, expressive heroes with tall spiky hair, huge shiny eyes with highlights, angular muscular poses and dramatic speed lines. Painted backgrounds with vivid sunset skies and mechanical interiors, flashy energy blasts in cyan, magenta and yellow, bold colour coding for groups of heroes, and heroines with long flowing hair and stars sparkling in the eyes. Rich classic 1970s TV anime look.'),
    ('Gainax', 'East Asia', '1990s-2000s', 'animation', 'In the style of Gainax, anime look with angular, sharp-chinned characters, thin lines, sleek armoured machinery, stark black title cards in heavy serif type on plain colour, glowing orange and violet sunsets, silhouetted skylines and tangled wires. Nervous close-ups on eyes, bold high-contrast colour fields in red, purple, white and teal, hot-blooded exaggerated poses with extreme foreshortening, and a mix of gritty realism and flamboyant over-the-top energy.'),
    ('Kyoto Animation', 'East Asia', '2000s-10s', 'animation', 'In the style of Kyoto Animation, exquisitely polished anime with soft pastel palettes, big luminous eyes with detailed iris gradients, delicate hair strands catching light, and everyday settings drawn with careful realism. Bokeh lens flares, gentle depth of field, cherry blossoms and glowing golden hour light. Smooth fluid motion, rounded cute faces with tiny blush marks, and a warm slice-of-life mood with luminous airy backgrounds.'),
    ('Soyuzmultfilm', 'Russia and Eastern Europe', '1950s-80s', 'animation', 'In the style of Soyuzmultfilm, hand-drawn and cut-out animation feel with soft gouache backgrounds in muted greens, earthy browns, dusty blue and warm ochre. Folk-tale forests, wooden huts and snowy villages, characters with round gentle faces, big noses and woolly fur textures, quirky puppet-like proportions, painterly grainy textures, simple slightly naive shapes and hand-lettered titles with a red star. Warm, melancholic, slightly surreal fairy-tale feel.'),
    ('Zagreb animation school', 'Russia and Eastern Europe', '1960s-70s', 'animation', 'In the style of Zagreb animation school, modernist flat 2D look with minimal geometric characters made of simple shapes, thin line work, little or no shading and large blank backgrounds in single flat colours. Witty visual metaphors, angular stylised figures with stick-like limbs, abstract pop-art colour blocks in red, yellow, black and sky blue, jazzy off-balance compositions and a sophisticated deadpan, urbane 1960s graphic-design look.'),
    ('Archie Comics', 'North America', '1950s-70s', 'comics', 'In the style of Archie Comics, wholesome teenage newsstand comic look with clean, uniform thin black outlines, simple friendly characters with round heads, dot eyes, button noses, bright wide grins and neat hairstyles. Flat saturated four-colour printing with halftone dots on slightly yellowed pulp paper in red, yellow, blue and green, sock-hop and soda-shop settings, speech balloons in a hand-lettered rounded face and a cheerful clean-cut mid-century small-town mood.'),
    ('Marvel Silver Age', 'North America', '1960s', 'comics', 'In the style of Marvel Silver Age, dynamic muscular heroes with dramatic foreshortening, bold black ink with heavy shadows and halftone dots in four-colour print. Primary red, blue and yellow with purple and green accents, fists bursting out of the frame, cosmic energy crackles, cheerful yellow caption boxes, bold all-caps hand-lettering with exclamation points, jagged starburst sound effects and a mighty boxed logo style.'),
    ('DC Golden Age', 'North America', '1930s-40s', 'comics', 'In the style of DC Golden Age, muscular flat-coloured heroes in tight capes and trunks over bold chest symbols, stiff but powerful poses, bold black ink outlines and simple shading. Limited four-colour palette of red, blue, yellow and green with coarse halftone dots on yellowing newsprint, city skylines with art deco towers, dramatic scenes of villains and lurid rays, wartime patriotic motifs, bold stacked lettering and a naive pulp-adventure energy.'),
    ('2000 AD', 'Europe', '1977-1990s', 'comics', 'In the style of 2000 AD, British sci-fi grit with hyper-detailed pen and ink, dystopian megacities of towering tenements and neon, helmeted enforcers in spiked armour, robots and aliens. Painted work with metallic airbrush gloss in lurid red, green and electric blue, black-and-white linework with dense hatching, jagged sound effects, a bold angular logo style and a loud, punky, sardonic and violent futuristic attitude.'),
    ('Tintin studio', 'Europe', '1930s-70s', 'comics', 'In the style of Tintin studio, the clear line school with uniform thin black outlines, flat cheerful fills and no hatching. Meticulously accurate backgrounds drawn with research and care, characters with round simple faces, dot eyes and an upswept tuft of hair, a limited palette of sea blue, sand yellow, warm red and green, stage-like compositions, tidy hand-lettered balloons and a glossy hardcover feel with a flat colour spine.'),
    ('Shueisha Jump', 'East Asia', '1980s-present', 'comics', 'In the style of Shueisha Jump, black and white manga look with dynamic action lines, bold inked outlines and screentone shading. Spiky-haired muscular heroes, enormous eyes, exaggerated expressions, huge sound effects in brush-like lettering, dramatic speed-line backgrounds, colour work in neon orange, cyan and yellow with a starburst title banner, tightly packed panels and a hot-blooded, high-energy weekly adventure look.'),
    ('Penguin Books', 'Europe', '1930s-60s', 'publishing', 'In the style of Penguin Books, a rigorous three-band layout with a central white panel framed by two coloured stripes in orange, green and blue. Title and author are set in clean sans-serif or classic serif inside the white band, with a small bird mark at the bottom. Later work uses a Swiss-style grid with bold illustration. Mid-century uncoated paper feel, matte printing and crisp rules.'),
    ('Taschen', 'Europe', '1990s-present', 'publishing', 'In the style of Taschen, oversized, heavy, coffee-table scale with glossy photo or painting imagery bleeding edge to edge, a plain contrasting colour bar or foil-stamped title and rich saturated reproduction. Large crisp images on thick paper, stylish clean sans-serif titles, a satin finish and a bold, sensual, curious art and pop-culture look. Layouts are generous and confident, with big margins of plain colour, dramatic cropping and a luxurious, collectable, gallery-like weight.'),
    ('Blue Note Records', 'North America', '1950s-60s', 'music', 'In the style of Blue Note Records, bold modernist graphic design with tightly cropped monochrome or duotone photography in blue, black and white. Large asymmetrical heavy sans-serif type in unexpected angled lines, slabs of solid colour in orange, red or cyan cutting across the image, tilted and overprinted lettering, thin rules and grainy high-contrast portraits. Cool, smoky, mid-century jazz club feel.'),
    ('Factory Records', 'Europe', '1979-1980s', 'music', 'In the style of Factory Records, cool, austere post-punk minimalism with large empty space and thin sans-serif type. Coded barcode-like or abstract geometric patterns, industrial hazard stripes in black and yellow, silver or metallic ink on matt grey stock, textured cardboard, muted greys, steel blues and muted pastel colours, grainy halftone photographs and a clinical, enigmatic, modernist attitude. Compositions are quiet and carefully spaced, with cool restraint, deliberate mystery and an industrial, coolly intellectual mood.'),
    ('Saul Bass era title houses', 'North America', '1950s-60s', 'film graphics', 'In the style of Saul Bass era title houses, bold flat cut-paper graphics with jagged torn black shapes and white or red hand-cut lettering. Angular silhouettes, arrows and stark symbols, a limited palette of black, white, orange and red, stylised spirals, kinetic typography that slides and spins, rough-edged textures and one simple powerful symbol per composition. Graphic, sharp, tense and modernist.'),
    ('Hammer Films', 'Europe', '1950s-70s', 'film', 'In the style of Hammer Films, gothic horror with richly saturated colour in blood red, deep green and midnight blue. Candle-lit castles, fog-wrapped graveyards and crypts, ornate Victorian costumes and capes, fangs, dripping crimson blood, dramatic painted imagery with looming shadows, lurid yellow and red lettering with jagged dripping edges and studio-built sets with painted skies. Lush, lurid storybook creepiness.'),
    ('Amblin', 'North America', '1980s', 'film', 'In the style of Amblin, suburban childhood adventure in the 1980s with kids on bicycles silhouetted against a huge glowing moon, warm backlit mist and lens flares, golden-hour streetlight beams, flashlights in dark woods and wonder-struck faces lit from below. Soft airbrushed glow in deep blue and orange, wide-eyed friendly creatures and a warm nostalgic magic-hour glow. Compositions use strong silhouettes, small figures under huge skies, hazy atmosphere and a sense of ordinary places turning magical after dark.'),
    ('A24', 'North America', '2010s-present', 'film', 'In the style of A24, minimalist, offbeat design with a clean sans-serif or serif title in white on a muted or saturated single colour, a stark centred or off-balance photograph, soft grainy film texture and pastel or sun-bleached colour or deep moody darkness. Symmetrical compositions, wide-angle lenses, naturalistic light, surreal touches and an arthouse, intimate, slightly uncanny indie look. Plenty of calm negative space, deadpan framing and subdued styling keep the mood quirky, tender and a little unsettling.'),
]
